        "detailed_description": "<strong>⚠️ Warning, Pilot:</strong><br><br>Space Tournament is <strong>hard</strong>. It’s built on <strong>realistic space physics</strong>: no drag, no brakes, no forgiveness. Every drift, every micro-adjustment counts.<br><br>If you love mastering deep mechanics, precision control, and that perfect moment when everything clicks, this game is for you.<br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🚀 Two Engines. No Brakes. Perfect Momentum. 💥</strong></h2>Space Tournament is a zero-gravity arcade racing game. You steer using just two thrusters: No brakes, no drag, just raw momentum. Learn to drift through space with perfect timing and feel the rush of mastering control in an environment that doesn’t forgive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/1189dde400b047762ba4f88b2460436a.poster.avif?t=1763508701\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/1189dde400b047762ba4f88b2460436a.webm?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/1189dde400b047762ba4f88b2460436a.mp4?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Gameplay</strong></h2>Steering is simple: left, right, and forward. But in space, nothing stops unless you make it. Every impulse counts.<br><br>You’ll bounce, spin, and oversteer: Chaotic constructions, traps, and gravity zones challenge your skills. Defy hazards like space mines, lasers, black holes, and boosters.<br><br>Beginner-friendly ship parts help you with the basics, but if you want those wild drifts to hit just right, it’s time to ditch the training wheels.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/896fcae1490eecbdcddd0b3a02b7efa7.poster.avif?t=1763508701\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/896fcae1490eecbdcddd0b3a02b7efa7.webm?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/896fcae1490eecbdcddd0b3a02b7efa7.mp4?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🛠️ Customize Your Ship</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Choose a hull with a weight and friction profile that suits you. Heavy ones stabilize, lightweight ones accelerate faster.<br></li><li> Unlock specialized engines: from precision control to high-thrust madness.<br></li><li> Pick your cockpit: beginner-friendly stability or full manual precision.<br></li><li> Paint your ship to crash in style. 😎</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/e584a03d6cc4a637adcdf21201853d9b.poster.avif?t=1763508701\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/e584a03d6cc4a637adcdf21201853d9b.webm?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/e584a03d6cc4a637adcdf21201853d9b.mp4?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧩 Missions &amp; Campaign</strong></h2>Progress through a handcrafted campaign of more than 80 unique missions guided by Scrappy, your charming helper bot.<br><br>Complete missions by racing, collecting orbs, or hauling space loot with a tractor beam. Dodge everything space throws at you.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/76c598653f14c2c7669fdb6ddf20dcd9.poster.avif?t=1763508701\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/76c598653f14c2c7669fdb6ddf20dcd9.webm?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/76c598653f14c2c7669fdb6ddf20dcd9.mp4?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏆 Leaderboards &amp; Replay System</strong></h2>Every mission has its own leaderboard with global rankings. Compare runs and optimize your drift line to climb the charts.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Replays validate your times and let you rewatch runs.<br></li><li> Challenge your old scores with ghost replays 👻<br></li><li> Add friends to easily track their progress</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/29ead76c9f2bb4b1efa918648d77f277.poster.avif?t=1763508701\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/29ead76c9f2bb4b1efa918648d77f277.webm?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/29ead76c9f2bb4b1efa918648d77f277.mp4?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🧠 Build Your Own Missions</strong></h2>The Mission Editor is the same tool we use to build the campaign. It’s intuitive, flexible, and packed with features.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build races, puzzles, or pure chaos<br></li><li> Add triggers and goals<br></li><li> Publish instantly and share with the world</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/f6958f135ad4fda9d933c5d3d6f69d02.poster.avif?t=1763508701\" width=616 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/f6958f135ad4fda9d933c5d3d6f69d02.webm?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1962020/extras/f6958f135ad4fda9d933c5d3d6f69d02.mp4?t=1763508701\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Unique zero-gravity control system with two throttles and no brakes 🚀<br></li><li> 80+ handcrafted campaign missions 🌌<br></li><li> Modular ship upgrades: hulls, engines, cockpits 🔧<br></li><li> Global &amp; friend leaderboards with replays 🏁<br></li><li> Fully featured mission editor with blueprints 🧠<br></li><li> Wide variety of hazards and mission types 💣<br></li><li> Controller and mobile support 🎮📱<br></li><li> A growing library of player-made content 🌍<br></li><li> Story-driven campaign with a helpful robot friend 🤖<br></li><li> custom paint jobs for personal flair 🎨</li></ul><strong></strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎯 Play the Demo Now!</strong></h2>Try the free demo and feel the momentum for yourself. Experience the twin-thruster challenge, test your skills on early campaign missions, and start creating your own tracks.<br><br><strong>Master the drift. Become the legend. 💫</strong>",
